1. Badges
Badge — biror narsaning sonini ko‘rsatish uchun ishlatiladi.
<a href="#">News <span class="badge">5</span></a><br>
<a href="#">Comments <span class="badge">10</span></a><br>
<a href="#">Updates <span class="badge">2</span></a>
2. Labels

Label — biror narsaga qo‘shimcha belgi/status berish uchun ishlatiladi.

Masalan:

New
Success
Warning
Danger
<h1>
    Example <span class="label label-default">New</span>
</h1>

<h2>
    Example <span class="label label-primary">New</span>
</h2>
<span class="label label-default">Default</span>
<span class="label label-primary">Primary</span>
<span class="label label-success">Success</span>
<span class="label label-info">Info</span>
<span class="label label-warning">Warning</span>
<span class="label label-danger">Danger</span>
//SELF
.label          → label yaratadi
.label-default  → oddiy
.label-primary  → primary
.label-success  → muvaffaqiyat
.label-info     → ma’lumot
.label-warning  → ogohlantirish
.label-danger   → xatolik/xavf
